<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`first`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`First`" pulumi-lang-go="`first`" pulumi-lang-python="`first`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`first`" pulumi-lang-java="`first`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`first`">`first`</span> where v6 defaulted it to <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`all`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`All`" pulumi-lang-go="`all`" pulumi-lang-python="`all`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`all`" pulumi-lang-java="`all`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`all`">`all`</span>, and a default applies wherever the configuration
